  DisplayName: An Old Trading Company Clears Its Warehouses
  EventType: 1
  Description: The old company that once traded with India {is clearing|will clear}
    its London warehouses before they are pulled down. Chests unopened for half a
    century {are sold|will be sold} by the lot, and Indian goods {go|will go} cheaply
    while the sale lasts.
